  <h2 id="sales">Who pays for these skills, and how they judge you</h2>

  <p>
    Clients, producers and audiences pay for stories that work and projects delivered on time. They judge you by your reel, reliability and teamwork.
  </p>
  <p>
    The first basic skill is finishing a small film from idea to final export.
  </p>

  <h2 id="ai">AI and film and video production: which tasks are under pressure</h2>

  <p>
    AI tools generate footage, clean audio and assist editing. Routine editing steps shrink.
  </p>
  <p>
    Storytelling, taste and accountability hold value. A staged path helps: now, use AI to speed up and experiment; later, own creative decisions.
  </p>

